# Feature: account
# Use-case: uc.account.set-avatar
# Use-case doc: ../../../../docs/wiki/features/account/use-cases/uc.account.set-avatar.md

### Start avatar upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/avatar/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentType": "{{avatarContentType}}",
  "byteSize": {{avatarByteSize}}
}

> {%
  client.global.set("avatarUploadRef", response.body.uploadRef);
  client.global.set("avatarUploadUrl", response.body.uploadUrl);
%}

### Upload avatar bytes to presigned URL
# Set avatarFilePath in http-client.env.json to a local PNG, JPEG or WebP before running this request.
PUT {{avatarUploadUrl}}
Content-Type: {{avatarContentType}}

< {{avatarFilePath}}

### Complete avatar upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/avatar/upload/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uploadRef": "{{avatarUploadRef}}",
  "contentType": "{{avatarContentType}}"
}
